From c3060fd96954141f1f85c47e510196e33a068770 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vadim <vmilyash@mts.ru>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 07:27:23 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] feat(platform): read-only opsplatform.Reader with
 allowlist (ADR-0026)

get/list over an allowlist of kinds (Secret is never readable), per-call deadline, paginated List with Truncated, pod logs with a byte cap, discovery with an explicit ErrPartial, k8s errors translated to the contract errors.

Signed-off-by: Vadim <vmilyash@mts.ru>
